  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar to initiate a Programme for Vocational Training/ Local Content</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to a seminar (work shop) to initiate a Programme for Vocational Training and Local Conten in the Oil and Gas Industry in Uganda. 
The goal of this seminar is to initiate a long term programme to strenghten the Ugandan business community&apos;s ability to acquire contracts in the Oil and Gas Industry supply chain, and thus make the Ugandans benefit from the Oil Industri, which in the long term aims to to ensure that the Industry creates lasting values for the country.</narrative>
  </description>
